'''Gacha Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in the [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]]. This cat can be unlocked by purchasing it from a special sale during the game's [[Anniversary]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 558
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Gacha Cat
|name2 = Lucky Gacha Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Lucky Gacha Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
At level 50, Gacha Cat has 153,000 HP, making him effectively a bootleg version of [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]]: a cheap, but strong tank that can hold the line still for a short while. His speed and need for boost, however, make it rather ineffective at that, especially before he receives such boost (level 50 is not available prior to beating [[Relic Bun-Bun]]), due to his low stats and the unusual way at which they grow. Ignore the chance to knockback, as that is way too inconsistent to ever be relevant.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Combo Slave}}

