==Trivia==
*Gacha Cat's English description contains an error, as there are two spaces between the words Capsule and Machine.
*Lucky Gacha Cat's English description may be referencing Frieza's transformation dialogue from ''[[wikia:dragonball:Dragon Ball Z|Dragon Ball Z]]''.
**It may also be a reference to the Lucky G capsule, stating that his Evolved Form is not even the "luckiest" one.
*Despite Gacha Cat's name, it is not a gacha unit.
*Gacha Cat, [[Principal Cat (Special Cat)|Principal Cat]] and [[Choco Capsule (Special Cat)|Choco Capsule]] are currently the only cats to have level scaling above 20%.

